 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "SnakeGame(rows, cols) starts a snake of length 1 at the top-left cell (0, 0) of a rows x cols board. move(direction) with direction \"U\", \"D\", \"L\" or \"R\" counts one move and steps the head one cell. On every fifth move (moves 5, 10, 15, ...) the snake grows: its tail stays put; on other moves the tail cell is vacated first. The game ends when the head leaves the board or enters a cell still occupied by the snake. move returns true while the game continues and false for the move that ends it and for every later move.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk08-b-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
